{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07728","headline":"和卢明府送郑十三还京兼寄之什 · 孟浩然","name":"和卢明府送郑十三还京兼寄之什","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔时风景登临地，今日衣冠送别筵。\n醉坐自倾彭泽酒，思归长望白云天。\n洞庭一叶惊秋早，濩落空嗟滞江岛。\n寄语朝廷当世人，何时重见长安道。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟浩然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07728.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07728","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}